From a.buness at dkfz-heidelberg.de  Tue Jul  6 13:42:27 2004
From: a.buness at dkfz-heidelberg.de (Andreas Buness)
Date: Tue Jul  6 13:42:30 2004
Subject: [BioC] dye-swap and arrayMagic
